#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-SEND-0324-A expect=skipped domain=PC
#note "PCULOQ is not declared - the NORMAL SENDIG shape, since no SENDIG version enumerates the model-permissible PCULOQ in PC. Since the R-4.11 hoist (2026-09-12 terminal review, MEDIUM-1) it is in Requirements.Variables.All, so this half reports an auditable SKIPPED naming PCULOQ instead of running to silence, and its ExecutabilityHint discloses exactly that. NO finding changes: the Check is a pure conjunction since the R-5.25 split, so no row could ever fire without the limit. Row 1 is above any plausible limit and PCSTRESC carries no token - data that WOULD fire if the column were present."
#library standard=sendig version=3-1-1
dataset PC class=FINDINGS label="Pharmacokinetic Concentrations"
col STUDYID  type=Char
col DOMAIN   type=Char
col USUBJID  type=Char
col PCSEQ    type=Num
col PCTESTCD type=Char
col PCORRES  type=Char
col PCLLOQ   type=Num
col PCSTRESC type=Char
---
S1 | PC | 001 | 1 | DRUGX | 250 | 5 | 250
